# e2e-tutorials: manifest.json + screenshots are regenerated on every scenario
# run (see e2e-tutorials/README.md) - only scenario.spec.js, narration.json, and
# generated/*.md are source of truth and get committed.
/e2e-tutorials/scenarios/*/manifest.json
/e2e-tutorials/screenshots/
/e2e-tutorials/.video-tmp/
/e2e-tutorials/videos/

